  plaqueTitle: ...
  plaqueDescription: A detailed miniature replica of the historic Paoay Church (Saint
    Augustine Church) in Ilocos Norte, a UNESCO World Heritage Site renowned for
    its colossal earthquake baroque buttresses and detached coral bell tower.
  artifactInspectionDescription: Hand-carved replica reproducing the 24 massive contoured
    buttresses and the iconic multi-tiered coral stone bell tower. The architectural
    masterpiece stands as an enduring monument to Filipino-Spanish colonial engineering.
